      "ArticleTitle": "[Comparison of the effects of regional ischemia and of reperfusion on the hypertrophied heart of spontaneously hypertensive rats and the heart of Wistar-Kyoto rats with isolated perfused heart via the left atrium. Effects of lidocaine, propranolol and verapamil].",
